who does the examination and provides care. Figure 9.13 shows the health care provider who gave the ante-
natal care by type of residence. In the ALCS interview, it was asked whether during the last pregnancy the
expectant mother saw any of the named providers. For each type of provider, the woman then had to answer
‘yes’ or ‘no’. This means that a number of women who h ad more than one ANC  visit, indicated they had
