9.4.2 Skilled birth attendance and place of delivery
Skilled birth attendance
To guarantee the health of the mother and the new-born child, each delivery should be assisted by a skilled
birth attendant and should take place in a hygienic, healthy and safe environment. In a study on the effect
of various childbirth care packages on neo-natal mortality due to intrapartum-related events, Lee et al. (2011)
estimated that globally intra-partum-related neo-natal deaths could be reduced by 25 percent by universal

